FerrionOS change to relibc (MIT license, kept), made against upstream commit 74b5e7e315043a21b599f271d5692727aa54f64d with the FerrionOS patches before it in recipe.toml applied, ferrion-gpu-syncobj.patch last among them:
- redox-ioctl: add WAIT_VBLANK (0x3A) and DrmWaitVblank wire payload for union drm_wait_vblank, with unit tests and size assertions for drm_wait_vblank and drm_mode_crtc_page_flip_target.
- sys_ioctl/redox/drm.rs: forward DRM_IOCTL_WAIT_VBLANK (0x3A) to the display scheme alongside existing DRM_IOCTL_MODE_PAGE_FLIP (0xB0).

